 "description": "Copy of \"anchor: access evaluation — user writes apply at once\" that sends resource_type when it creates a role or permission. It replaces the original once ADR-0022 PR 1 is deployed. anchor#252 access evaluation, user path: the dev org's real synced member joins a throwaway org with a throwaway reader role and is evaluated right after each write: allowed with role/org/user echoed; MISSING_PERMISSION; a permission granted to the role applies on the next call; a deleted workspace is refused (WORKSPACE_NOT_IN_ORGANIZATION); a removed member is refused (NOT_A_MEMBER). Org, role and 15-min key deleted always and read back. Generator: gen_access_user_freshness.py.",
 "updated_at": "2026-10-30T19:51:14.172815Z",
